1
00:00:00,409 --> 00:00:01,949
I did not wanna do this...

2
00:00:02,119 --> 00:00:05,209
...but I have here the rare,
mint-condition, production-era...

3
00:00:05,372 --> 00:00:08,912
...Star Trek: The Next Generation
Geordi La Forge without his VISOR...

4
00:00:09,084 --> 00:00:10,464
...in the original packaging.

5
00:00:11,044 --> 00:00:13,464
If you do not get out of my way...

6
00:00:13,630 --> 00:00:15,460
...I will open it.

7
00:00:16,341 --> 00:00:18,301
(Howard:)Okay, man, be cool.

8
00:00:19,052 --> 00:00:20,682
(Howard:)We're all friends here.

9
00:00:21,930 --> 00:00:23,560
(Penny(coming out of her flat):)What the hell's going on?

10
00:00:23,724 --> 00:00:26,354
- You hypocrite.
- What?

11
00:00:26,518 --> 00:00:29,018
Little Miss Grown-Ups-
Don't-Play-With-Toys.

12
00:00:29,187 --> 00:00:32,737
If I went into that apartment right now,
would I not find Beanie Babies?

13
00:00:32,899 --> 00:00:35,779
(Sheldon:)Are you not an accumulator
of Care Bears and My Little Ponies?

14
00:00:35,944 --> 00:00:38,864
(Sheldon:)And who is that Japanese feline
I see frolicking on your shorts?

15
00:00:39,031 --> 00:00:41,571
Hello, Hello Kitty.

16
00:00:44,453 --> 00:00:47,623
(Penny:)Okay, okay, look,
if this is about yesterday, Leonard...

17
00:00:47,789 --> 00:00:50,539
(Penny:)...I am really sorry about what I said.
I was just upset.

18
00:00:50,709 --> 00:00:53,459
- No, I needed to hear it.
- You didn't. You are a great guy.

19
00:00:53,628 --> 00:00:56,798
And it is the things you love
that make you who you are.

20
00:00:57,299 --> 00:01:04,019
(Howard:)I guess that makes me large breasts.

